---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Notes from building small iOS apps, plus news on Apple and AI.
---
<section class="wrap section">
  <p class="eyebrow">Blog</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Notes from the build</h1>
  <ul class="post-list">
    {%- for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p class="muted">{{ post.data.description | truncate(200) }}</p>
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | longDate }}</time>
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
